  "steps": [
    {
      "content": "鸭肉清洗一遍放进锅中",
      "duration_minutes": null,
      "tips": ""
    },
    {
      "content": "加清水淹没鸭肉",
      "duration_minutes": null,
      "tips": ""
    },
    {
      "content": "加 20 ml 料酒",
      "duration_minutes": null,
      "tips": ""
    },
    {
      "content": "加备用的 1 根 大葱",
      "duration_minutes": null,
      "tips": ""
    },
    {
      "content": "加生姜 ,拍散的 2 厘米",
      "duration_minutes": null,
      "tips": ""
    },
    {
      "content": "开火烧滚",
      "duration_minutes": null,
      "tips": ""
    },
    {
      "content": "捞出浮沫",
      "duration_minutes": null,
      "tips": ""
    },
    {
      "content": "鸭肉捞出,清水洗干净备用",
      "duration_minutes": null,
      "tips": ""
    },
    {
      "content": "锅清洗感觉烧热，加 60ml 的花生油",
      "duration_minutes": null,
      "tips": ""
    },
    {
      "content": "油温到 60 度的时候,加一把花椒（ 30 颗）",
      "duration_minutes": null,
      "tips": ""
    },
    {
      "content": "加鸭肉翻炒 4 分钟",
      "duration_minutes": 4.0,
      "tips": ""
    },
    {
      "content": "2 分钟后加入所有的香料",
      "duration_minutes": null,
      "tips": ""
    },
    {
      "content": "3 分钟的时候加入所有的料头（生姜,大蒜,小米辣）",
      "duration_minutes": null,
      "tips": ""
    },
    {
      "content": "加入 1000 ml 的啤酒",
      "duration_minutes": null,
      "tips": ""
    },
    {
      "content": "烧鸭肉 30 分钟",
      "duration_minutes": 30.0,
      "tips": ""
    },
    {
      "content": "10 分钟的时候加 盐 （3 克） 生抽( 10 ml ) 老抽( 5 ml)",
      "duration_minutes": null,
      "tips": ""
    },
    {
      "content": "20 分钟 加入所有的辅料 （青椒和红椒段）",
      "duration_minutes": null,
      "tips": ""
    },
    {
      "content": "29 分钟加入 蒜苗段 和 大葱段",
      "duration_minutes": null,
      "tips": ""
    },
    {
      "content": "翻炒 1 分钟",
      "duration_minutes": null,
      "tips": ""
    },
    {
      "content": "出锅",
      "duration_minutes": null,
      "tips": ""
    }
  ],
  "tips": [
    "操作时，需要注意观察沸腾的水位线，如发现低于 2/3 的食材应加热水或者加啤酒。",
    "厨师长：用土灶烧“乡村啤酒鸭”，味道安逸得不摆了(https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1R4411u7po?spmidfrom=333.999.0.0)"
  ],
  "description": "将鸭肉与啤酒一同炖煮成菜，使滋补的鸭肉味道更加浓厚，鸭肉不仅入口鲜香，还带有一股啤酒清香。一般初学者只需要 1 小时即可完成。"
}